^{:go/end 301} (go/method WriteStringPad "WriteStringPad writes the first n bytes of s.\nIf n is larger than len(s) then it is padded with the bytes in pad (repeated as needed).\n" [^{:tag (* OutBuf)} out ^string s ^int n ^{:tag (slice byte)} pad]
