^{:go/end 323} (go/method WriteSym "WriteSym writes the content of a Symbol, and returns the output buffer\nthat we just wrote, so we can apply further edit to the symbol content.\nFor generator symbols, it also sets the symbol's Data to the output\nbuffer.\n" ^{:tag (slice byte)} [^{:tag (* OutBuf)} out ^{:tag (* loader/Loader)} ldr ^loader/Sym s]
